  "details": "Since the recent update, an issue occurs when bunny hopping in VRChat. Occasionally, after landing a bunny hop, the player enters a sliding state (as if slipping on ice) and is unable to jump, making movement difficult.\n\nSteps to reproduce:\n\n1. Move forward and repeatedly jump (bunny hop) in any world.\n\n2. Occasionally upon landing, the character starts sliding uncontrollably and input for jumping stops responding temporarily.",
